  "description": "CR 613.7a a granted devoid clears an OLDER 'in addition' colour",
  "note": "The routing gate, and the falsifier for folding a granted devoid in as a CDA. Painter's Servant resolves first naming blue, so its effect carries the older timestamp (CR 613.7a) and the Drone is blue. Slivdrazi is cast afterwards, so its grant is newer: within layer 5 the blue applies first and the grant clears it. Folded in as a CDA, the blue would land on top, as it does for the printed devoid in the CR 613.3 scenario beside this one. Slivdrazi's first ability is load-bearing: only it makes the Eldrazi a Sliver (layer 4) for its second to reach. The Haskell test places Slivdrazi; here it is cast, so alice has a land of each colour and a Wastes.",
